#. Description of the plugin
#: openmerch-woocommerce.php
msgid "Adds a \"Customize\" button next to Add to Cart on WooCommerce product pages, opening the OpenMerch editor in a new tab via a postMessage bridge, and syncs paid orders back to your self-hosted OpenMerch Engine instance."
msgstr ""

